{
  "title": "Quietly Creamy Irish Corn Stew",
  "description": "A post-workout Irish dish featuring creamed corn, served in a mason jar, this stew is a comforting and grassy treat. It is carefully prepared to be onion and garlic free.",
  "cuisine": "Irish",
